## Project structure
+ rendering: vite, water+static assets on canvas
+ libraries: vite, react 
+ assets: uploaded svg (assets), rendered in json (src/data)
First the text signs in json are translated to letters and each letter has a predefined color (ColoredSprite.tsx). 

